WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:06.730
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.550
<i>This is a warning to</i>
<i>everyone on the Ryvius!</i>

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.790
<i>I hereby prohibit any and all</i>
<i>acts of violence aboard the ship!</i>

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:38.660
<i>If anyone is caught breaking this rule,</i>
<i>I'll resort to force with the Vital Guarder!</i>

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.300
What are you saying, Ikumi?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.810
<i>Do not make a mistake!</i>
<i>Do not cause trouble!</i>

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.830
<i>Do not fight! Do not blame others!</i>
<i>Do not hurt others! Remain calm!</i>

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.740
<i>I don't wish to hurt anyone! But, if</i>
<i>anyone is caught hurting others I'll...</i>

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:57.910
<i>... I'll!! I'll! I WILL!!</i>

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.350
Ikumi.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.730
I'll... I'll...!

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:21.270
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:28.820
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.820
Although loneliness...

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:37.160
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:44.390
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:49.470
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.440
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:59.970
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.750
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.380
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.080
Some light is shed...

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:15.660
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:22.900
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:30.900
The things I want have no shape

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:39.310
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.360
We Don't Need Tomorrow

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.650
There's no other way.
I have no choice but to do this.

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:11.080
There's no other way.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.480
Who's there?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.720
Yuki? There's no use trying to stop me.

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:21.160
I'm gonna return the Ryvius
back to normal. No matter what!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.820
Who said anything about stopping you?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.600
You guys...!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.810
Don't get me wrong.
I came here on my own accord.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.470
Besides, you're not gonna be able
to control this thing on your own.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.380
Am I wrong?

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.610
Thanks.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.080
I'm not doing it for you.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:45.410
You're right. Both you and I have
people to protect. That's why...!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:49.180
I warn everyone on the Ryvius one last time.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:54.790
If there is any trouble, I will abandon
you and take away the Vital Guarder!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.570
<i>All you have to do is not fight.</i>
<i>I'm just telling you to do the obvious.</i>

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.030
<i>To do what's expected</i>
<i>from any normal person!</i>

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.170
You're coping with the
situation beautifully, Ikumi Oze.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.770
- Wh-What'll we do?
- Don't ask me.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.100
Juli.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.210
I know. Yes, I know.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.480
<i>This is Juli Bahana from the bridge.</i>

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.580
<i>I'm sure you must all be</i>
<i>surprised at the announcement.</i>

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.560
<i>I ask that you all calm down.</i>

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:26.420
<i>We have confirmed that Ikumi Oze is</i>
<i>in fact aboard the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.500
<i>We are still uncertain</i>
<i>of his real intention...</i>

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.930
<i>... but whatever it is, it doesn't change the</i>
<i>fact that we're facing a new situation.</i>

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:34.900
Don't worry.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.270
- I'll protect you.
- <i>Without the power of the Vital Guarder...</i>

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.310
- Really? You promise?
- <i>... it is almost impossible...</i>

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.040
Yeah.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.480
- Why won't they stop the cheap threats?
- <i>... for the Ryvius to ascend from Sere 5.</i>

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:44.380
- But the Vital Guarder's been taken.
- <i>We intend on beginning discussions...</i>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.850
- I'll bet it's all a lie!
- <i>... with Ikumi Oze immediately...</i>

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.150
- But this is a good thing.
- <i>Until we've come to a decision...</i>

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.920
- 'Cause now the bad guys will behave.
- <i>... I sincerely ask that everyone...</i>

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.490
What should we do?

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.320
- Things will end up just fine.
- <i>... be prudent with their actions.</i>

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:56.520
But in the meantime, lend me your points.
I'll be sure to win this time.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.220
What?

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.830
Ikumi, can you hear me?

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.160
This is Juli Bahana. Please answer me.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.060
<i>Yeah, I can hear you.</i>

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.830
Why are you doing something so foolish?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.420
<i>Is there any other way?</i>

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.930
<i>It's the best scenario that</i>
<i>this fool could come up with.</i>

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.670
I won't take that bull!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.880
You just wanna survive,
at the cost of others!

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.380
<i>Don't group me with the likes of you...</i>

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.710
<i>... who was quick to discard Fu,</i>
<i>Michelle, and their friends!</i>

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.580
<i>What I'm hoping for is some</i>
<i>constructive discussion!</i>

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.650
Ikumi Oze.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.710
I always thought of him as some
passive jerk, but he's got it together.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.880
- Right?
- Yeah.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.850
Don't you see this as a
really great opportunity?

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.500
- Faina.
- That announcement...!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.230
There's no reason to be nervous.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.400
Ikumi is only guiding us to
the path that we are to take.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.500
I can see our future.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.340
Stay here. Don't go out, no matter what.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.350
And you, Lucson?

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:58.280
I'll go and steal... ah, no, procure some
food to prepare us for the worst situation!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.990
Where are you? Where?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.620
I've lowered all partitions
that lead to the bridge.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.460
We don't want any more riots, after all.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.270
Men...!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.170
We hear your concerns, and we're gonna
persuade everyone, so come back Ikumi!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:22.380
<i>Come back?</i>
<i>You're completely missing the point!</i>

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:26.480
<i>All you need to do is use</i>
<i>me to calm everyone down!</i>

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.450
<i>Tell them that they'll</i>
<i>be killed if they don't!</i>

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.470
There's no way we can do that!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.890
<i>What did you say?</i>

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.850
You're doing nothing
but intimidating people!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.920
Wait a minute.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:40.980
I believe this is a valid method to control
the present disorder aboard the ship.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:45.330
If Ikumi Oze's ability to act
can bring order to the Ryvius.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.470
But...!

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.960
<i>I'm only doing the same thing Airs Blue did,</i>
<i>the guy you love so much.</i>

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.600
It all makes sense now.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:59.070
<i>All I'm hoping for is to contrive a way</i>
<i>to dampen all the turmoil on the Ryvius.</i>

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.610
<i>You're smart, so you must</i>
<i>have some ideas of your own.</i>

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.350
Then let me say one thing.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.850
My understanding is
that at this moment...

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:10.550
...your message hasn't got
across to everyone on board.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.680
I believe there is a need to set an example
with the use of the Vital Guarder's powers.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.560
Heiger!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.500
I support Ikumi Oze on this.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.570
So do I.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:21.470
Yeah.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:22.900
Well, then count me in too.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.240
It seems treatment will be better,
compared to when Blue was in charge.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.140
Idiot.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.080
<i>How do you suggest I
<i>display such power?</i></i>

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.950
A moment ago a message was
received from section 156...

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:38.390
...about bodily harm caused.
Please attack that section.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.450
- <i>What?</i>
- No way!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.620
Certain risks must be
taken to establish order.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:48.290
If you really want to bring order
to the Ryvius, then please attack.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:52.830
<i>If you are unable to do it, I suggest</i>
<i>that you get off the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:57.600
<i>Ikumi Oze. Answer me.</i>
<i>Will it be order, or renunciation?</i>

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.210
<i>Everyone's escaping.</i>

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.200
Did you say section 156?

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:06.480
<i>Yes.</i>

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.950
Hey, you in section 156!

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.420
I thought I told you to stop fighting!

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.720
If you can't do as I say,
I'll just have to take action!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.520
<i>I'm gonna attack that section</i>
<i>with the Vital Guarder!</i>

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.430
<i>I'm giving you three minutes!</i>

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.600
- <i>If you wanna run away, do so now...</i>
- He's bluffing.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.190
- <i>... never make the same mistake again!</i>
- But what if he's serious?

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:25.950
I'm serious!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.930
Where are you? Where?

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.700
Open up! Please! Let me talk with Ikumi!

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:37.730
<i>Anyone who cannot remain calm</i>
<i>doesn't belong on the Ryvius!</i>

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:38.710
Ikumi!

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.000
That bastard. He really did it!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.200
Ikumi...!

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:07.140
Y-Yes, that's the way.
This is how it should be.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.450
<i>There were no signs of anyone</i>
<i>remaining in section 156.</i>

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.420
Now you know! I am serious!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.850
If you understand, then
resume your assigned work.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.860
You're all doing this
for no one but yourselves!

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:33.200
<i>From now on, I will not allow any</i>
<i>injustice, no matter how minor!</i>

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.900
<i>And I mean it!</i>

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:37.700
How could he?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.140
That was an enormous bet.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.270
I hope it was the first and last.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.170
Unlikely, I'd say.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:47.410
Yeah. I know.
There are tons of things yet to be done.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.180
We'll bring the Vital Guarder
back and dock with the Ryvius.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.850
Yeah.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.330
Not this way either. Damn!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.420
Can't I do anything about this? Can't I?

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.500
<i>That's not in your character, Kouji.</i>

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:13.910
<i>If you try too hard, you'll end up failing.</i>

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.540
I...!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.250
- Kouji.
- Aoi?

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.650
You fool! I told you not to
walk outside on your own!

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:26.210
But there's no one around.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:30.510
Not you. Not Yuki. I was alone!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.790
I'm sorry.

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:38.370
<i>This incident greatly changed us...</i>
<i>changed the Ryvius.</i>

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.400
<i>And my own friend changed it.</i>

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.800
<i>It all happened in a place I didn't know,</i>
<i>a situation I could not handle...</i>

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.100
<i>... and in shape and form</i>
<i>that I did not prefer.</i>

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:47.910
<i>Ikumi!</i>

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.350
Why did this have to happen?

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.910
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:09.890
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.060
<i>Since Ikumi Oze took</i>
<i>over the Vital Guarder...</i>

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.930
<i>... almost a month has passed.</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.740
<i>The Ryvius left the vicinity of Saturn and</i>
<i>set a course for the vicinity of Uranus.</i>

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.800
<i>There is still no sign of rescue.</i>

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:28.070
<i>On the surface, it appeared as if</i>
<i>our life had returned to normal.</i>

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:31.520
<i>But there was definitely more tension</i>
<i>in the air compared to one month ago.</i>

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:36.080
<i>People were tied down by</i>
<i>something not visible to the eye.</i>

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.990
<i>An invisible fear.</i>

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.650
<i>At the suggestion of Stein Heiger...</i>

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.720
<i>... the living quarters were closed off</i>
<i>into sections of about 50 people each.</i>

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:48.470
<i>The reason behind it being that if</i>
<i>disputes arose from people interacting...</i>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.700
<i>... then we could minimize the incidents.</i>

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.640
<i>With an immense wall known as</i>
<i>information keeping watch...</i>

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.740
<i>... evil deeds were almost non-existent,</i>
<i>even towards those with special benefits.</i>

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.210
<i>It's a rational way of thinking, typical</i>
<i>of something Heiger would come up with.</i>

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:05.610
<i>Furthermore, those agreeing with Ikumi's</i>
<i>intentions gathered to form a group...</i>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.040
<i>... called the Guardians.</i>

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.390
<i>Among the members were those</i>
<i>previously thought to be detained...</i>

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.620
<i>... the likes of Michelle Cay,</i>
<i>Fu Namuchai, and Ryu Gil.</i>

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.790
How dare you do what
you did to Michelle!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.730
We're going to tear you to pieces!

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.070
B-But...!

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.300
At the time I had no choice
but to do what I did.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.140
How dare you!

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:27.640
Stop it!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:33.010
Why? This person betrayed me...
No, he betrayed us all.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:35.010
Whatever the case, stop it!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:37.640
I let you become a Guardian member
because you promised to support me.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.010
If you do anything to promote trouble...

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.390
...I'll personally see to it
that you're severely punished.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.380
That goes for you guys too, got that?

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.720
- Y-Yeah.
- I understand.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.590
Don't overlook any crime,
no matter how small.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.700
And if anyone resists?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.970
Take necessary steps to fit the situation.
You're used to that, aren't you?

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:56.470
For guys that just won't listen, right?

00:12:56.470 --> 00:13:01.240
Yeah. Teach them what's right and
what's wrong, until they understand.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.970
<i>Honestly, what</i>
<i>surprised me the most...</i>

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.610
<i>... was that Faina S. Shinozaki</i>
<i>was in agreement with Ikumi.</i>

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.510
<i>Also, she!</i>

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.090
Titania in the Uranus region?

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:16.920
Yes. I'm the granddaughter of Prime
Minister Lawrence, ruler of Titania.

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:19.830
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.820
Titania's far, and I was afraid
it would end up like Hyperion.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.200
You're sure we'll be protected
when we get there, are you?

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:32.240
Yes. Titania is not part of the alliance,
so I'm sure it will be okay.

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:36.080
<i>It's approximately two months to Titania.</i>

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:40.080
<i>If we can endure this hellish life</i>
<i>that long, we'll all be free.</i>

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:45.680
<i>I wish that we would get there an hour,</i>
<i>even a second earlier.</i>

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:51.150
<i>November 4, 2225,</i>
<i>second term student...</i>

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.060
<i>... Liebe Delta Navigational</i>
<i>Department, Juli Bahana.</i>

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.730
<i>To think that this is all I can do.</i>

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.720
<i>How powerless I am.</i>
<i>Help me, Blue.</i>

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:09.680
As a result, my ID has been changed,
I can't see Ikumi...

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.340
...and on top of it all,
Yuki's cooperating with Ikumi.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.620
- So?
- Ah, well...

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.140
...I was wondering what
you'd do in my position.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:20.580
I'd use what you have
stashed away in your pocket.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:22.420
Right away.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.670
How is it?

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:43.570
The number of incidents
has gone down...

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.710
...to less than three percent of last month.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.980
Three percent...!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.080
This is a model example
for a social system.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.950
To me, this is like utopia.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.490
It's not zero yet.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.080
But the possibility of that happening...!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.410
We must do it!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.290
As you've been told a number of times,
if you're caught for any infraction...

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:05.460
...all of your points will be confiscated.
If you wanna eat, shut up and line up.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.430
Hey, is this all?

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.860
There's not enough here for him to eat!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.540
Get outta the way!
There's a lineup behind you!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.140
Never mind, Lucson.
I'm not working, after all.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.470
Just the same...!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.480
What are you doing? Let go!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.480
This guy stole your points, didn't he?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.470
Ah, actually I sort of
gave him the points...!

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.820
There you have it! So let me go!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.220
- You're coming with me!
- What a fool.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.820
- Ow! Let go! I've done nothing wrong!
- Can't he do things a bit more cleverly?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.880
If you want food, then line up properly.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.160
Well... excuse me...!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.830
<i>This isn't good.</i>
<i>I'm just going with the flow.</i>

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.240
<i>Not being able to do a thing, I!</i>

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.730
Your strengths will be needed for our future.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:49.770
Please help to soothe the souls
of those who are exhausted.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:53.740
Kouji.

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.550
Faina. Please. Let me
get in touch with Ikumi.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.480
I can't get past the partitions with my ID.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.950
I have something to tell him, so...!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:07.820
I can't do that. Because you'll cause
Ikumi to dwell upon the past.

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.990
He is trying to grasp the future.
That's a wonderful thing.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:15.490
If you want to meet with Ikumi,
you should return to special status.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:20.040
Just move into my room.
Then you can!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:23.130
I can't do that. I can't leave her alone.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:24.780
Aoi?

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.440
Yeah.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:31.720
Faina...!

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.890
Right. There was something I
wanted to ask someone to do.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:53.930
<i>What's the big idea</i>
<i>disrupting order around here?</i>

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.670
<i>I told you. Worthless people</i>
<i>will always be worthless.</i>

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.280
<i>I-I'm terribly sorry. Please forgive me.</i>

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:05.220
Why is it? Why can't
they do the obvious?

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:08.320
This won't do. It won't.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.910
Hang in there, Ikumi.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.390
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.980
Otherwise, how am I
supposed to protect you?

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:17.990
All I want is for you to live in peace.
I don't care for anything else.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.230
What's this? There aren't any points!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.030
Think of the risk we took for nothing!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.140
Damn you!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:32.240
Don't tell anyone, all right?
This guy's useless.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.250
That would just blow
things out of proportion.

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:44.290
It's meaningless unless we can stop
abruptly in the simulation too.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.590
We'll create at least three patterns.

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:49.250
What? You're asking for too much.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.330
If you don't wanna die, then do it.

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:55.000
Okay, okay. And, haven't you
guys come to a decision yet?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.100
About what?

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.100
You haven't seen her for
about a month, right?

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:00.160
What are you getting at?

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:05.540
<i>I'll show you what the definitive difference is,</i>
<i>between you and I.</i>

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:22.860
Kouji?

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:27.900
Oww...!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.640
NOOO!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.170
Why are you doing this?

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.500
You're scaring me. You're hurting me.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.530
Aoi! What's wrong?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.250
Aoi!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.510
Are you all right, Aoi?

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.320
No! Stay away!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.280
- No! No!
- It's me, Kouji!

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:47.450
NOOO! NOOO!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:48.680
Aoi!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:50.780
Aoi!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.250
- Kouji?

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:58.860
Why was I? I was... no... NOO!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.170
Hey, calm down!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.860
- I... I...!
- It's all right now.

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:07.770
This is crazy. Totally crazy.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:11.040
Why must I remain in a place like this?

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.350
Aoi...!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:15.510
When Liebe Delta was ready to dive,
you said you weren't going home!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.950
You two are always fighting, so I...!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.220
You stayed because of us?

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:24.550
Sorry. I didn't wanna go home.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.930
I also wanted to stay
away from my Mom.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.190
- Why?
- Please don't! Don't take me away!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.300
Then you shouldn't have
boycotted your work!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.470
We'll teach you how
you were mistaken!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:37.500
- Please don't! Don't do it!
- Damn! They're too forceful!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.900
Don't go! Stay here with me.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.170
Aoi?

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:47.050
I can't believe that Yuki would
play a part in something like this.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.070
- Right.
- It's crazy, right?

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.020
Yeah.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.920
This isn't happening, is it?
This isn't real, is it?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.020
Aoi?

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.890
This can't be reality.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.290
When tomorrow comes,
I'll wake up from all this.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:03.420
On my way to school,
I come across your house, Kouji.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.700
Once again, you'll be in
a fight with Yuki...

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.690
...so I think, "oh, boy"
and go to stop the fight.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.340
You both have an expression on
your face, "It's <i>his</i> fault"...

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.440
...and you both get
scolded by your mom...!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.710
I'm right, aren't I? Tell me I'm right.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.600
If you say so, Kouji, I can believe it.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.710
I can believe that this isn't true.
Please! Tell me, Kouji!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.180
You're wrong.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.760
This is reality.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.250
We're not on earth. We're aboard the Ryvius.

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.090
Ikumi and Yuki have left us.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.260
Kozue's hurt, and Reiko's
whereabouts are unknown.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.930
In addition, many people
have lost their lives.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.160
Why do you say such things?

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:47.270
Comfort me!
Tell me everything's gonna be all right!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.810
Face the present!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.070
No!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.510
Please, Aoi!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.910
- No way! I don't wanna do that!
- This is reality!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.990
Why? You're being cruel.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:02.250
Why would you say such a terrible thing?
I don't want that.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.290
But... it's true.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:07.930
Kouji?

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:10.560
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:15.530
Neither... Neither... Neither do I want...!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:23.440
Kouji. No, don't cry! Please don't cry!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:28.180
Don't cry! Please!

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.540
Even though I'm this sad.

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.410
Kouji. Kouji.

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:00.680
<i>To hell with tomorrow.</i>

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:02.910
<i>We're better off if</i>
<i>tomorrow never comes.</i>

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:11.810
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:16.880
...a silhouette appears

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:21.590
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:28.320
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:37.740
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:46.350
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:54.790
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:58.690
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:05.060
goodbye

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:11.020
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.390
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: In Order to Survive

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:12.490
Next episode: In Order to Survive

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.960
Next episode: In Order to Survive
