00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:24.970
Next episode: In Order to Survive
Also hidden is an operation
that we were completely unaware of.

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.800
Next episode: In Order to Survive
An operation of great significance...

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.300
Next episode: In Order to Survive
